---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /australia/authors/
title: "Australia Financial Experts & Authors – CalcPhi"
description: "Meet CalcPhi's Australia editorial team — CFA charterholders, CPA Australia members, and CFPs who verify every Australia calculator formula against ATO and APRA guidelines."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Home
    url: /
  - name: Australia
    url: /australia/
  - name: Our Authors
---

<main id="main-content">

  <div class="authors-page-header">
    <div class="authors-page-header__inner">
      <p class="authors-page-header__eyebrow">Australia Editorial Team</p>
      <h1>Australia Financial Experts</h1>
      <p class="authors-page-header__sub">Every Australia calculator and article on CalcPhi is written and independently verified by a qualified Australian financial professional — CFA, CPA, or CFP — with direct knowledge of ATO, APRA, ASIC, and Services Australia regulations.</p>

      <div class="authors-trust-bar">
        <div class="authors-trust-badge">
          <span class="authors-trust-badge__icon">◆</span>
          CFA Institute
        </div>
        <div class="authors-trust-badge">
          <span class="authors-trust-badge__icon">◆</span>
          CPA Australia
        </div>
        <div class="authors-trust-badge">
          <span class="authors-trust-badge__icon">◆</span>
          FPA Certified CFP
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="authors-list-wrap">
    <div class="authors-list">
      {% for key, author in authors %}
      {% if author.market == "australia" %}
      <article class="author-row">
        <a href="{{ author.url }}" class="author-row__photo-link">
          {% authorImage author.image, author.name + ", " + author.title + " at CalcPhi", 160, "author-row__photo", "lazy" %}
          <span class="author-row__cred-badge">{{ author.credentials }}</span>
        </a>
        <div class="author-row__content">
          <div class="author-row__header">
            <div class="author-row__identity">
              <h2><a href="{{ author.url }}">{{ author.name }}</a><svg class="verified-badge" aria-label="Verified author" title="Verified" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#1d9bf0"/><path d="M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></h2>
              <p class="author-row__title">{{ author.title }}</p>
            </div>
            <a href="{{ author.url }}" class="author-row__btn">View Profile →</a>
          </div>
          <p class="author-row__bio">{{ author.shortBio }}</p>
          <div class="author-row__footer">
            <div class="author-row__tags">
              {% for skill in author.expertise | slice(0, 4) %}
              <span class="author-row__tag">{{ skill }}</span>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <div class="author-row__articles-count">
              <span>{{ author.articles | length }} article{% if author.articles | length != 1 %}s{% endif %} published</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="editorial-pledge">
    <div class="editorial-pledge__inner">
      <div class="editorial-pledge__heading">
        <p class="authors-page-header__eyebrow">Our Standards</p>
        <h2>The CalcPhi Australia Editorial Pledge</h2>
        <p>Every formula and rate is cross-checked against ATO Tax Determinations, APRA quarterly statistics, ASIC guidance, and Services Australia publications. Updated within 7 days of any ATO or Budget announcement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="editorial-pledge__grid">
        <div class="editorial-pledge__item">
          <span class="editorial-pledge__num">01</span>
          <h3>ATO & APRA Verified</h3>
          <p>All tax and super content is verified against current ATO public rulings and APRA reporting standards before publication.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-pledge__item">
          <span class="editorial-pledge__num">02</span>
          <h3>ASIC & Services Australia</h3>
          <p>Age pension rates and Centrelink thresholds are sourced directly from Services Australia publications. Loan comparison rates follow ASIC guidelines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-pledge__item">
          <span class="editorial-pledge__num">03</span>
          <h3>Updated Within 7 Days</h3>
          <p>When tax rates, super caps, or Centrelink thresholds change, affected pages are updated within 7 days of the official announcement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-pledge__item">
          <span class="editorial-pledge__num">04</span>
          <h3>Editorial Independence</h3>
          <p>No calculator result or recommendation is influenced by advertising or affiliate relationships. Accuracy only.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="authors-bottom-cta">
    <div class="authors-bottom-cta__inner">
      <p>Use our Australia calculators to run the numbers on your own situation.</p>
      <a href="/australia/" class="cta-link">Explore Australia Calculators →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:2rem auto;padding:1.5rem 2rem;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:var(--r-md);">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Our Editorial Standards</h2>
    <p>Every calculator and article on CalcPhi Australia is produced by qualified finance professionals with direct experience in Australian taxation, superannuation, and financial planning. Our team holds credentials from CAANZ, CFA Institute, CFP Board, and Australian universities.</p>
    <p>We follow a strict accuracy protocol: all figures are cross-referenced against ATO publications, APRA guidance, ASIC regulatory releases, and RBA data before publication. Rates and thresholds are updated within 48 hours of any regulatory change.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin:1rem 0 0.5rem;">What "Verified Content" means on CalcPhi</h3>
    <p>Each article carries a byline from the author who researched and wrote it. A second qualified team member reviews every article for factual accuracy before it is published. The reviewer's name appears in the article metadata. This two-step process is how we maintain accuracy across super, tax, mortgage, and investment content.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:1rem;margin:1rem 0 0.5rem;">No sponsored conclusions</h3>
    <p>CalcPhi accepts display advertising but our editorial output is completely independent. No advertiser influences which calculators we build, which strategies we recommend, or how we present regulatory information. If a strategy has a downside, we say so. Our reader trust depends on it.</p>
    <p>Questions about our editorial team or verification process? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>

</main>
